 "drug_rule": "Buspirone is a weak CYP3A4 inhibitor. Combined with a CYP3A4 substrate, it can reduce clearance of the substrate, leading to increased systemic exposure. In this case, the increased estrogen exposure from the oral contraceptive may heighten the risk of venous thromboembolism, hypertension, and other estrogen-dependent adverse events.",
